WEBVTT

NOTE The Haunted House (1921) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Buster Keaton in
"The Haunted House"

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.700
[music]

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:12.490
Written and directed by
Buster Keaton and Eddie Cline

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:21.250
Wall Street: the palatial
parking place of the Bull and
the Bear—mostly the Bull.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.000
New York is not the only town
that has its master mind of
finance.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:18.250
The bank cashier and his band of
counterfeiters have a strong
reason for making people believe
this house is haunted.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.000
"I'll show you what would
happen if the police came."

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:08.000
"The time lock doesn't
open till nine o'clock."

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:11.000
Although it's a small bank it
has a President, and although he
is a small man he has a
daughter.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:35.500
"I wonder who put counterfeit
money in the bank—I'll ask the
police."

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:20.500
That night the Daredevil Opera
Company was executing
"Faust"—and he deserved it.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:26.250
After searching everywhere else
the police found him where he
was.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.500
"That house is haunted."

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:15.250
"The little fellow from
the bank is upstairs."

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.500
THE END
